e early adoption.","lessons_learned":["Ecosystem capital is not the same thing as company financing or a verified treasury value.","A fresh TVL peak can reverse quickly; retention must be measured explicitly.","Rollup trust assumptions need visible evidence, not a generic inherited-security claim."],"could_differ":"Consistent application demand and incentive-independent liquidity could turn the rollup’s capital base into durable network effects.","outlook":{"bull":"Applications and liquidity retain users after incentives, increasing rollup fee relevance.","base":"Mantle continues as a smaller L2 with episodic liquidity and ecosystem support.","bear":"Liquidity and activity remain incentive-sensitive while other L2s capture distribution.","most_likely":"base"},"cause_tags":["ethereum_l2","liquidity_incentives","governance_treasury","retention_risk"],"confidence":"medium"}},"meta":{"dimension_completeness_pct":100,"data_completeness_pct":77,"confidence":"medium","unsourced_fields":["capital.total_raised_usd","capital.treasury_usd","team.named_founders","team.regulatory_status","onchain.active_addresses_daily","onchain.dev_activity_monthly","onchain.tvl_concentration","onchain.stablecoin_tvl_usd"],"last_reviewed":"2026-07-29"}}
